<title>UK: Fidelity in Qatar deal to distribute its products.</title>
<headline>Fidelity in Qatar deal to distribute its products.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Investments has joined forces with the Commercial Bank of Qatar to distribute Fidelity's products through the bank's branch network in Qatar.</p>
<p>Fund management group Fidelity has over 290 billion sterling assets under management and the Commercial Bank of Qatar has seven branches and manages assets of 46 billion sterling, Fidelity said in a statement. --London Newsroom 44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
